  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neighbourhood Investment Platform (NIP): New decision to recommit EUR 10 million for European Palestinian Credit Guarantee Foundation (EPCGF) Gaza (EU mandate)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPCGF provides partial credit guarantees for investment and working capital loans to small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), partial portfolio guarantees for loans to micro- and small-sized enterprises (MSEs) and partial loan guarantees covering commercial borrowing of microfinance institutions (MFIs) from banks operating in the Palestinian Territories, notably Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
